mke2fs
Usage: mke2fs [-Fn] [-b BLK_SIZE] [-i INODE_RATIO] [-I INODE_SIZE] [-m PERCENT] [-L LABEL] BLOCKDEV [KBYTES]

Create an ext2 filesystem on a block device.

	-b BLK_SIZE	Block size, bytes
	-F		Don't ask, just format
	-i INODE_RATIO	Max number of files is filesystem_size / INODE_RATIO
	-I INODE_SIZE	Inode size (min 128)
	-L LABEL	Volume label
	-m PERCENT	Percent of blocks to reserve for admin
	-n		Dry run
